Licensing scope for Better SMTC Bridge
=====================================

This project contains original SMTC Bridge material by nutty (nuttylmao)
and new contributions by Sveenet, plus separately licensed dependencies.

Original SMTC Bridge code and assets
-----------------------------------

Copyright remains with the original authors. The reviewed upstream repository
provides no public license. This project does not relicense or grant general
reuse rights to the original SMTC Bridge code or assets. Rights to reuse that
material must be obtained separately from its rights holder. See
docs/provenance.md for the source and boundaries of that material.

Original additions by Sveenet
-----------------------------

The following MIT terms apply only to the original additions identified in
docs/provenance.md. In files containing upstream material, these terms cover
only Sveenet's original contributions, never the pre-existing code or assets.
They do not override the original rights holder's terms or dependency licenses.
A standalone copy of these MIT terms is supplied in LICENSE-MIT. Our original
additions may be used, modified, redistributed and used commercially under
those terms, with the required copyright and license notice retained.

